<title>CANADA: EnerMark closes Quest merger.</title>
<headline>EnerMark closes Quest merger.</headline>
<dateline>CALGARY 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>EnerMark Income Fund and Quest Oil &amp; Gas Inc said on Tuesday that Quest shareholders voted overwhelmingly in favor of the merger with EnerMark.</p>
<p>The British Columbia Supreme Court granted approval for the deal last week and the closing of the plan of arrangment occurred today.</p>
<p>Holders of Quest shares and warrants received about C$112.5 million in cash and 1.2 million EnerMark trust units under the offer.</p>
<p>((Reuters Calgary Bureau (403) 531-1624))</p>
</text>
